extrastereo audio filter (src/audio/extrastereo.ts)

src/audio/extrastereo.ts adapts the extrastereo filter of FFmpeg
libavfilter/af_extrastereo.c: its m and c options and their ranges and
defaults, the packed float format and stereo layout of query_formats, and the
per-sample loop of filter_frame (average, difference scaling and av_clipf_c
clipping), with every intermediate rounded to float as in the C source.

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
